   },
   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "At x = 1 the numerator is 1 + 2/(-2) = 0 and the denominator is 1 - 1 = 0, so the quotient is zero over zero.",
         "mathjson": 0
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "Combine the numerator over the common denominator x - 3: x + 2/(x - 3) = (x^2 - 3x + 2)/(x - 3) = (x - 1)(x - 2)/(x - 3), so the quotient is (x - 1)(x - 2)/((x - 3)(x - 1)).",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Multiply",
               [
                  "Subtract",
                  "x",
                  1
               ],
               [
